# PROJECT CLOUP: MASTER APP PROMPT & SPECIFICATION

## 1. APP CONCEPT & CORE IDEA
- **Name:** Cloup
- **Core Purpose:** A mobile app that allows users to seamlessly transfer contacts, files, and their app list from an old phone to a new phone via the cloud.
- **The "Drop Here" Button:** The signature restore feature. Users tap it on a new device to pull their backed-up data instantly.
- **App List Transfer (The Smart Way):** Instead of trying to backup APKs (which is illegal/blocked), Cloup scans the installed apps, grabs their real names, icons (logos), and package names, and converts them into Google Play Store links. On the new device, it shows a grid of these apps looking exactly like a real app drawer, with a "Reinstall" button that opens the Play Store.
- **Platform:** Built using Capacitor (HTML/CSS/JS), targeting Android first. 

## 2. MONETIZATION & STORAGE LOGIC
- **Free Tier:** 2 GB of storage. Perfect for backing up thousands of contacts and small files. Contacts and App Links will always be free to backup, even if the 2GB is full.
- **Paid Tier (The Business):** Users pay a monthly subscription (via MTN MoMo/Paystack/Hubtel) to unlock 50GB / 100GB / 200GB to backup heavy files (photos/videos).
- **Database / Storage Architecture:** 
  - Use a "Storage Router" backend.
  - Start with Cloudflare R2 (no egress fees, cheap).
  - API connects Phone -> Backend -> Cloud. (Never direct from phone to cloud).
  - **Smart Compression:** Do NOT compress photos/videos (they are already compressed). ONLY compress contacts, JSON, and text files to save space.
- **Fast Parallel Transfer:** The app must support downloading/uploading 5 to 20 files at once simultaneously (using concurrent workers) to make backups and restores extremely fast.

## 3. UI/UX & DESIGN SYSTEM
- **Vibe:** Premium, native mobile app feel (NO web browser feel). 
- **Colors:** "Very Soft Dark" (Not pure black). 
  - App Background: `#1C1C1E` (with a very soft gradient to `#121212`)
  - Card Backgrounds: `#2C2C2E`
  - Secondary Surfaces/Buttons: `#3A3A3C`
  - Text Main: `#FFFFFF` (White)
  - Text Muted: `#98989D`
  - Borders: `#3A3A3C`
  - Accent Green (Primary): `#34C759`
  - Warning/Upgrade Amber: `#FF9F0A`
- **Icons:** NO emojis/stickers. Use pure, crisp SVG line-art icons (stroke-based).
- **Spinner:** Google/Material style (big, green arc on a gray track). Show it during screen loads.
- **Rules:** 48dp+ tap targets, `user-select: none`, `-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent`, native `transform: scale(0.97)` on button press.

## 4. THE LAYOUT & 5 BOTTOM TABS
The app features a 5-tab fixed bottom navigation bar. 

1. **Home (Backup Screen):**
   - Storage meter (e.g., 0.8 / 2 GB) with a green progress bar.
   - "Upgrade for more" text button.
   - 3 Category Cards: Contacts (👤), Files (📁), My Play/Apps (📱).
   - Big primary green button: "BACKUP ALL NOW" (with a sync SVG icon).
   - Last backup time text.
   
2. **Restore (Cloud Screen):**
   - Large cloud SVG icon with a down arrow.
   - Text: "Restore to this phone".
   - Big secondary button: "DROP HERE".

3. **Device (Current Apps):**
   - Shows apps currently installed on the phone.
   - Displays real app icons and names with an "Installed" label.

4. **My Play (App Restore Screen):**
   - Shows the apps from the OLD phone.
   - Grid layout (2 columns).
   - Each tile: Real App Logo, App Name, and a "Reinstall" button.
   - Tapping "Reinstall" opens the Play Store link.

5. **Settings:**
   - List view: Account, Plan, Restore History, Help & Support.

